 R←Test_ListRepos_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;stop;cfgFilename;data;json
⍝ Exercise ]GitHub.ListRepos with the -permanent flag
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 cfgFilename←##.GitHub.GetConfigFilename
 'Create!'##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.CheckPath ##.GitHub.GetPathToConfig
 (⊂'{owner: "firlefanz",}')⎕NPUT cfgFilename 1

 stop←0
 (rc msg data)←stop UCMD'ListRepos ''aplteam'' -permanent'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 json←⊃⎕NGET cfgFilename
 data←⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊣json
 →T.GoToTidyUp'aplteam'≢data.owner

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}##.GitHub.FilesAndDirs.DeleteFile cfgFilename
⍝Done
